Modification Notice
-------------------

These GGUF files are modified derivatives of Google Gemma 4 31B-it. The
modification is a small F32 scale patch applied to selected layer output
scale tensors. The exact patch identity is encoded in each filename and
documented in `README_paper_v5.md` and `HF_MODEL_CARD.md`.

The patching method is reproducible from the scripts in this release
bundle. The code for those scripts is covered by `LICENSE-CODE`; the
resulting model weight files remain model-weight artifacts under the
Gemma 4 Apache 2.0 license basis above.

